# Never send local secrets or build output into a Docker build context. Without this file,
# `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile baked a developer's .env (JWT_SECRET, DATABASE_URL) into an
# image layer whenever the image was built locally (SECURITY_AUDIT.md S26). The image installs
# and builds its own dependencies, so node_modules and .next are not needed either.
.env
.env.*
node_modules
.next
.git
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
prisma/dev.db
Proposal
